{
	"name": "Dedicated Guardian",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/fire/dagger-rune-enchant-flame-strong-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have trained yourself into a noteworthy protector of your ideals, combining magical and martial training in the process. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Strength, Constitution, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with your choice of two of the following skills and/or tools: Insight, Intimidation, Investigation, Medicine, Religion, herbalist kits, or a musical instrument.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with the Sanctified Steel combat tradition and learn a maneuver from it. It does not count against your maneuvers known.</p></li><li><p>You have proficiency with shield bash attacks. This does not grant you proficiency with other improvised weapons. The base damage of a shield bash becomes 1d6 for you.</p></li></ul>",
